han ever.&\nAs this chart from Statista shows, Amazon is credited with shipping 41% of the 11.7 million smart speakers distributed worldwide this past quarter, with Google coming in second with 27.6% of shipments. Apple came nowhere close to either of its rivals, with the Cupertino-based giant only shipping off 5.9%.\nThe big takeaway: Amazon's competitors are slowly, but surely, gaining traction in the smart speaker race. The company no longer has as big of a lead as it did in Q2 of last year.\nSEE ALSO:& This chart shows how far Samsung has to go with its new Galaxy Watch to challenge Apple for smartwatch dominance\nJoin the conversation about this story »\nNOW WATCH: Everything wrong with the iPhone", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~4/k4PL91M6uu4", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=k4PL91M6uu4:gYW71NXfc2I:qj6IDK7rITs", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=bcOpcFrp8Mo", "https://www.statista.com/chart/13931/smart-speaker-shipments/", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=k4PL91M6uu4:gYW71NXfc2I:V_sGLiPBpWU", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=k4PL91M6uu4:gYW71NXfc2I:bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=k4PL91M6uu4:gYW71NXfc2I:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=k4PL91M6uu4:gYW71NXfc2I:V_sGLiPBpWU", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=QXVau8BzmBE", "https://www.businessinsider.com/iphone-issues-problems-hardware-software-ios-2018-7", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=k4PL91M6uu4:gYW71NXfc2I:QXVau8BzmBE", "https://www.businessinsider.com/samsung-galaxy-wat